 "remarks": "Welcome to SONO Place! This stylish 1-bedroom condo offers the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and flexibility, featuring a dedicated garage parking space plus a bonus loft area ideal for a home office, guest space, or potential second bedroom. The bright and airy living/dining area boasts soaring 13-foot ceilings and oversized windows that fill the space with natural light. The kitchen is equipped with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and a natural gas range. A generously sized bedroom offers ample closet space, while the full bathroom includes both a tub and shower. Additional features include hardwood floors throughout, central air conditioning, natural gas heat, and an in-unit washer/dryer combo. Water is included in the rent. Pet-friendly for cats and small to medium-sized dogs. The building offers secure elevator access and on-site guest parking. Ideally located in the heart of South Norwalk, you'll be just steps from the train station, restaurants, shopping, parks, The SoNo Collection, and everything this vibrant neighborhood has to offer. Available now!",
